<title>USA: Precision Systems names Huisman chairman.</title>
<headline>Precision Systems names Huisman chairman.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PETERSBURG, Fla. 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Precision Systems Inc said on Friday Wim Huisman, president and chief executive, was appointed to the additional title of chairman.</p>
<p>Huisman replaces Richard Liebhaber who resigned as chairman and the board of directors, the company said.</p>
